   "text": "INTO Manchester - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO Manchester\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nINTO Manchester is a multi-pathway Study Centre that offers all successful students a conditional place at one of NCUK's partner universities, including the University of Birmingham, Durham University, the University of Bristol, The University of Manchester and The University of Sheffield.Wide university recognition: 90+ UK universities have welcomed over 3,500 INTO Manchester students.Dedicated Placements team to provide practical advice and assistance to students completing their university applications.A Study Centre equipped with excellent, modern learning facilities.Top 10 most exciting city in the world (Time Out City Life Index 2018).\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:19\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:19\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £19,650.00\nMin: £11,650.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n12%\n1,440 of 12,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n2004\nCampus(es)\nManchester\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAs accommodation is allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, students should confirm their place soon after receiving an offer to have the best chance of getting their preferred option.\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gCMWIKTe_nE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
